<p>jab shaah ko safar me bohat din guzar gaye<br />
sughra ko gham huwa ke musaafir kidhar gaye<br />
kehti thi ghar bhara huwa veeraan kar gaye<br />
kya jaane kis taraf mere bekas pidar gaye</p>

<p>hai shouq dil me sibt-e- payambar ki deed ka<br />
kya wajha hai ke qat nahi aaya raseed ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pardesiyo'n ke gham me hai jeene se mujh ko yaas<br />
bistar pe mu lapete padi rahti hu udaas<br />
baba safar se aayenge jab tak na mere paas<br />
tab tak badan se mai na utarungi ye libaas</p>

<p>jeeti rahi to vasl-e- imaam-e- zaman huwa<br />
aur mar gayi to bas yahi kurta kafan huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aati nahi hai kuch qabar-e- syedul anaam<br />
basti kaha'n basaayi kiya kis jagah maqaam<br />
kyu naani jaan aaap to sunti thi wo kalaam<br />
ruqsat ke waqt mujh se jo farmaate the imaam</p>

<p>kehte the khat bhi aayega akbar bhi aayenge<br />
sughra na ro'o ham tumhe jaldi bulaayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekho na khat hi aaya na akbar waha'n se aaye<br />
kuch haadesa pada shah-e- dee'n par safar me haaye<br />
kis se kahu jo sibt-e-nabi ki qabar ko jaaye<br />
allah mere baap ko jaldi watan me laaye</p>

<p>sunti hu dost kam hai shah-e mashraqain ke<br />
dushman bohot hai fatima ke noor-e- ain ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maango dua ke sibt-e- payambar ki qair ho<br />
abbas-o- qaasim-o- ali akbar ki qair ho<br />
behno ki qair ho meri maadar ki qair ho<br />
garmi ka hai safar ali asghar ki qair ho</p>

<p>amma ko unka doodh badhaana naseeb ho<br />
phir ghar me leke qair se aana naseeb ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke mu ko dhaanp ke royi wo nouhagar<br />
kurta tamaam hone laga aansuo'n se tar<br />
naani dilaasa dene lagi paas aan kar<br />
qurbaan jaau roti ho kyu dhyaan hai kidhar</p>

<p>veeraa'n karenge shaher ko jangal basaayenge<br />
ab kya quda na qaasta hazrat na aayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>charcha huwa ye shehr-e- madina me jaa bajaa<br />
sughra se aake maadar-e- abbas ne kahaa<br />
zaanu pe sar jhukaaye huwe ro rahi ho kyaa<br />
shabbir aaye shukr ka sajda karo adaa</p>

<p>naake pe fouj tehri hai waari hussain ki<br />
aati hai koi dam me sawaari hussain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naani ne tab ye usse kaha hoke shaad shaad<br />
sughra tumhe na tha mere kehne ka etemaad<br />
mai kehti thi ke aate hai ab shaah-e- qush nehaad<br />
poori quda ne ki jo mere dil ki thi muraad</p>

<p>dekhungi aaj baap ko maadar ko bhaai ko<br />
lo kapde ab badal lo chalo peshwaayi ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo boli mere dil me hai kuch aur hi qayaal<br />
jab tak na ghar me aayega qairun-nisaa ka laal<br />
kapde na badlungi na mai goondungi sar ke baal<br />
aane do unko jin ke liye hai ye mera haal</p>

<p>shikwa karungi aankho se aansu bahaaungi<br />
baba ko ye phataa huwa kurta dikhaaungi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>
keh kar ye baat ghar se chali duqtar -e- anaam<br />
naani bhi saath hogayi jaldi asaa ko thaam<br />
dekha har ek taraf ko hai qilqat ka isdedhaam<br />
kehne lagi ye maadar-e- abbas-e- nekh naam</p>

<p>mujh ko to hai yaqeen ke ab ghar na aayenge<br />
shabbir pehle qabr-e- payambar pe jaayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke god me liya beemaar ko uthaa<br />
aur ruq kiya sue lahad-e- paak-e- mustafa<br />
nazdeek jab gaye to ye ghul ek ba ek huwa<br />
aaya hai aye hussain ke beemaar-e- karbala</p>

<p>maatam karo habeeb-e- quda ke habeeb ka<br />
sar kat gaya badan se hussain-e- ghareeb ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye saakinaane shehre madina udhaao qaak<br />
kar daalo aah apne garebaan chaak chaak<br />
shabbir teen roz ka pyaasa huwa halaak<br />
chaaleeswi talak raha be gor jism-e- paak</p>

<p>paaoge phir na fatima ke noor-e- ain ko<br />
ham karbala me dafn kar aaye hussain ko<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>